The legal text in this repository is the official text of the Constitución de la República Oriental del Uruguay
and of the codes and laws listed in README.md, as published by the Dirección Nacional de Impresiones y Publicaciones Oficiales (IMPO), Base de datos de
normativa (https://www.impo.com.uy/bases), and by the Parlamento del Uruguay (https://parlamento.gub.uy). Lexifina
makes no claim to it. Source of the text and of every date and reference: IMPO and the Parlamento del Uruguay.

Nota de origen (IMPO open data). The texts and data from IMPO are used under the Licencia de Datos Abiertos –
Uruguay, version 0.1:
https://www.impo.com.uy/wp_impo/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/licencia-de-datos-abiertos.pdf
- Provider / Proveedor: IMPO, Dirección Nacional de Impresiones y Publicaciones Oficiales.
- Licence / Licencia: "Licencia de Datos Abiertos – Uruguay", version 0.1.
- Datasets used / Conjuntos de datos: the IMPO legislation database (Base de datos de normativa,
  https://www.impo.com.uy/bases), above all Leyes, with Decretos-Ley, the codes, the Constitución and the original
  texts of laws.
- Changes / Cambios: the texts were changed. They were assembled into a dated version history, with formatting
  normalised (los textos se ordenaron en una historia de versiones fechadas y se normalizó el formato).

This repository is not an official publication. Only the texts published by IMPO and the Parlamento are
authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, Lexifina has waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to this work.
